---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import IgnyteMark from '../components/IgnyteMark.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="About">
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-10 animate-rise">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl mt-2">Built inside a real club,<br /><span class="ignite-text">not a boardroom.</span></h1>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4 text-mist-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Ignyte Club Manager is part of the <strong class="text-mist-100">Ignyte</strong> family —
        the same umbrella behind Ignyte Cheer &amp; Dance. We run a club ourselves: the website
        that never got updated, the WhatsApp scrums for slots, the class lists on paper, the
        payment chasing, the spreadsheet gymnastics on coach pay night. So we built the whole
        thing — website, classes, privates, memberships and payments — as one platform.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every feature comes from a real gym floor. Waiting lists offer freed spaces
        automatically because ringing round is a job nobody has time for. Trials chase
        themselves up because that's how squads grow. Payments collect themselves because
        chasing money is the worst part of running a club. And skill journeys exist because
        the question every parent asks is the same one:
        <em class="text-mist-100">"is it working?"</em> — now the app answers it after every session.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're cheer and dance first — tumble progressions and all-star dance skills come
        pre-loaded — and we keep it affordable for real clubs, because we are one.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 surface-card p-5">
      <IgnyteMark size={40} />
      <div>
        <p class="font-display font-semibold">Same umbrella. Separate spark.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-mist-400">Ignyte Club Manager · an Ignyte company</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 flex gap-3">
      <a href="/pricing" class="btn btn-primary">See pricing</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</AppLayout>
